  description: A wearable and flexible device that is designed to add length and
    girth to the penis. It slides on over the penis and includes a ring at the base
    to secure it to the testicles. It is often used by people with erectile dysfunction
    (ED) or premature ejaculation (PE).
  usageInstruction: '1. Place the penis sleeve over your partially erect or flaccid
    penis.

    2. Secure the penis sleeve in place. Some penis sleeves have a stretchy
    ring that attaches around your scrotum, a flexible hole you can place your testicles
    in, or a harness to keep the sleeve in place.

    3. Apply lube to the inside
    or outside (or both) of the penis sleeve.

    4. When your penis is fully erect,
    it should stay in place with minimal effort.'
